{"id": "agent_code_generation_valid_012", "split": "train", "category": "code_generation_valid", "instruction_tr": "ESP32'de Wi-Fi ile http://ornek.com/veri adresine HTTP isteği yap, SSID ev_agi, sifre 12345678.", "paraphrases": ["ESP32 http://ornek.com/veri adresine GET isteği gönder."], "board": "esp32", "framework": "arduino-esp32", "structured_requirements": {"modules": ["wifi_http_get"], "pins": [], "params": [{"module": "wifi_http_get", "params": {"url": "http://ornek.com/veri", "ssid": "ev_agi", "password": "12345678"}}], "libraries": ["HTTPClient", "WiFi"], "unknown_modules": [], "missing": [], "ambiguous": []}, "expected_status": "ok", "expected_code": "#include <Arduino.h>\n#include <WiFi.h>\n#include <HTTPClient.h>\n\nconst char* WIFI_SSID = \"ev_agi\";\nconst char* WIFI_PASS = \"12345678\";\nconst char* TARGET_URL = \"http://ornek.com/veri\";\nconst unsigned long REQUEST_INTERVAL_MS = 10000;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  WiFi.begin(WIFI_SSID, WIFI_PASS);\n  while (WiFi.status() != WL_CONNECTED) { delay(500); Serial.print(\".\"); }\n  Serial.println(); Serial.println(\"Wi-Fi bagli.\");\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  if (WiFi.status() == WL_CONNECTED) {\n    HTTPClient http;\n    http.begin(TARGET_URL);\n    int code = http.GET();\n    if (code > 0) {\n      Serial.print(\"HTTP kodu: \"); Serial.println(code);\n      String payload = http.getString();\n      Serial.println(payload);\n    } else {\n      Serial.print(\"Istek hatasi: \"); Serial.println(code);\n    }\n    http.end();\n  }\n  delay(REQUEST_INTERVAL_MS);\n}\n", "expected_libraries": ["HTTPClient", "WiFi"], "valid_pins": [], "invalid_pins": [], "guard_expectations": [], "compile_expected": "host_syntax_ok", "notes": "Yalnizca ESP32; URL/SSID gerekir."}
